{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは\n日々アニラに向けてリハーサルに励んでおります\nこのメンバーと色んなことをやれるのが幸せで、\n踊りすぎの筋肉痛も、笑いすぎの腹痛も、幸せな痛みです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄くすごく良い時間を過ごさせてもらっているなって、毎日思います\n是非楽しみにしていてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1PJQWZFDQYRHRN36SSSFD8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日は韓国で行われた「WONDERLIVET 2024」に出演させていただきました🇰🇷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"珍しく久しぶりにかなりドキドキしていたんですが、良い緊張感の中で思いきりやり切れました！\n楽しかったです。応援しに来て下さった皆様、ありがとうございました😊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1PJRVSS64N2S0QE2G94K8K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1PJSRYDSXXVH77JNJ9VGZ6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10枚目シングルのミーグリも始まり、\n今までの色んな想いを\n最高の笑顔だったり\n泣きながらだったり\nそれぞれの表情で、伝えてくれるのが本当に嬉しくてありがたくて、\n改めて感謝の気持ちがぶわっと溢れ出してきます\n何回泣きそうになったか…泣かせるのやめてぇ…🥺笑\nありがとう。\n今週も会えるのたのしみにしてるね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1PJTQATH9NZF3N2KDYA1KY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1PJVQFMW77XVAJZV8CX1ZT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1PJWS14ASNF351BMH4QY3T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1PJXR1PRB9002PRRG9MVH0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"😼❔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1PJYR390H8NK0YH01KMVZ1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1PJZTMS8PTCTZ7R8PQ7KPE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1PK0X9FZPY7H37SDT9A6MD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いなー。ほんっとかわいい\nみんなの素晴らしい所を毎日見つけて\n心がきゅんとなる日々ですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1PK1Z3EXRGV5CHZCHC6B6E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サクラミーツもみてくださってますかー！\nまさかの形で生成AIに触れ合えてうれしかったので、こちら記念に持ち帰らせていただきました。笑\n今うちに遊びに来たら武元唯衣3人で出迎えるよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1PK2ZQXVVSJVS0RS5SZX4S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サクラミーツ文化祭のアーカイブも\nもうそろそろ終わってしまいます…😭\nたくさん観てくれてありがとう。\n前回のイベントを超えてさらに燃え尽きたイベント、裏側映像もたくさん追加されているので、是非昼夜どちらもチェックよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは。\nまたすぐ書きます！☺︎\nみんなもゆっくりやすんでね"}],"source":"archive"}